@baseUrl = http://localhost:5003
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Health Check (Database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Health Check (Media Tools & Storage)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/media-tools

### OpenAPI JSON Document (Native .NET 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Scalar Interactive API Reference
GET {{baseUrl}}/scalar/v1

### Auth - Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Auth - Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Categories - Get All Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Categories - Create Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Science & Tech"
}

### Videos - Get Paginated Video List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/videos?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Videos - Search Videos by Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/videos?search=tutorial&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Videos - Continue Watching
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/videos/continue-watching?limit=6
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Videos - Favorites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/videos/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Downloader - Get Active & Historical Jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/downloader/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Settings - Get Current Downloader Settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
